'''Lugia ex''' (Japanese: '''ルギアex''' ''Lugia ex'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

