==Trivia==
The {{TCGP|immersive card}} was originally due to feature artwork by [[SIE NANAHARA]], and was included in internal game files prior to the release of the card on July 30, 2025. Shortly before the official release of the card, a statement was issued, confirming that "the card production team provided incorrect reference materials as official documents" for the creation of illustrations for {{TCG ID|Wisdom of Sea and Sky|Ho-Oh ex|210}} and Lugia ex; both affected cards were temporarily replaced with blank placeholder images.<ref name="statement1"/> Both new cards received updated artwork and immersive animations, once again by SIE NANAHARA, on August 8, 2025.<ref name="statement2"/>

