===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Lugia}}.
*'''Elemental Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Genesis|Lugia|9}} from the {{TCG|Neo Genesis}} expansion; it has appeared exclusively on cards depicting {{TCG|Lugia}}.

